<title>UK: Vodafone 185,000 net new subscribers in Q3.</title>
<headline>Vodafone 185,000 net new subscribers in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vodafone Group Plc, the mobile telephone company, said on Tuesday it had added 185,000 net new worldwide subscribers during the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Its worldwide subscriber base now totals almost 3.5 million, the company said in a press statement.</p>
